SUMMARY:Stand-Up Showcase
LOCATION:DC Improv\, 1140 Connecticut Avenue NW\, Washington
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy great stand-up comedy in downtown DC. Our showcase lineup
 s feature top talent from DC\, Maryland\, Virginia and beyond\, performing 
 on one of the country's most famous stages. You'll see a variety of styles 
 and get up close with some of the stars of tomorrow. Support local talent\,
  support local business and (most important) laugh your a** off. Showcases 
 generally last around 90 minutes.\n\nAugust 14-16 lineup: Dom Grayer\, Liam
  Nelson\, Dom Hatton-Woods\, Ty Colgate\n\nAugust 21-23 lineup: Kade Wonder
 s\, Garrett Harvest\, Aminah Imani\, Randy Syphax\, Jamal Russell\n\nAll sa
 les are final. Refunds and exchanges are offered only when a show is cancel
 ed or rescheduled.\n\nAdmission Policies\n\nPatrons must be 18 or older to 
 attend events or classes at the DC Improv. Any exceptions are clearly noted
  in the event descriptions.\n\nThere is a two-item minimum per customer. Th
 is can be any combination of food items or beverages. Bottled water and sof
 t drinks count as items. (The two-item minimum does not apply to comedy cla
 sses.)\n\nCoupons or passes for free admission cannot be used for a show li
 sted as a "special event."\n\nSeating Policies\n\nAll shows in our lounge s
 howroom are seated by time of arrival. The earlier you arrive\, the more op
 tions you'll have. Please note that the size of your party can affect what 
 options are available to you\, as certain tables and areas are designated f
 or larger parties.\n\nFor general admission tickets\, if your party does no
 t fill an entire table\, you may be sharing a table with other patrons.\nMo
 re info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-showcase-20482
 /
